# promptkit

Type-safe prompt template library for TypeScript. A 2KB primitive that turns prompt placeholder typos into `tsc` errors before they reach the model.

## Non-goals

promptkit is **variables only**. No template logic — no <code>{'{{#if}}'}</code>, no loops, no DSL. If you need conditionals or iteration, build them in TypeScript and pass strings.

